WEBVTT

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:04.934
Reporting time — Your hours, sick and vacation days — in a few taps.

00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:11.493
On a phone, WorkDesk opens on Time. The bar at the bottom has Time, Plan, Expenses and More.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:18.587
At the top: the hours you've reported today, and the timer. Start it when you begin, stop it when you finish — the entry fills itself in.

00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:21.995
Or report afterwards: Report without the timer.

00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:27.962
The same form as on a computer: type, date, start and end…

00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:34.547
…the hour type — Yellow for client work, Red for company time, Blue for managing projects…

00:00:35.145 --> 00:00:37.651
…then the client and project.

00:00:42.431 --> 00:00:44.433
Say what you worked on…

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.283
…and Save entry.

00:00:52.944 --> 00:00:57.546
Each entry is a card: hours and colour, date and time, client and project.

00:00:58.146 --> 00:01:01.651
Edit, Duplicate to other days, or delete.

00:01:02.315 --> 00:01:05.318
Move between months at the top of the list.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:11.294
Managers can switch to Me and my team — and Filter &amp; sort narrows the list down.

00:01:16.356 --> 00:01:20.461
Tap · report · done — More help: the Handbook → Time Log.
